COMMENT RA and Dec are in degrees.                                              COMMENT Reference values are ADS bibcodes.                                      COMMENT Period is in days.                                                      COMMENT M1 is the presumed accretor mass in solar masses.                       COMMENT M2 is the presumed donor mass in solar masses.                          COMMENT M1_sin3i is the projected mass term of the accretor (M1*sin(i)^3).      COMMENT M2_sin3i is the projected mass term of the donor (M2*sin(i)^3).         COMMENT evol_type_1 and evol_type_2 are assumed evolutionary stages for accretorCOMMENT  and donor.                                                             COMMENT obs_type_1 and obs_type_2 are observational types (for example spectral COMMENT class) for accretor and donor.                                          COMMENT system_class is the broad class of binary system.                       COMMENT quality_flags marks entries with assumed values or minimum/maximum constCOMMENT raints.                                                                 COMMENT --BEGIN-ASTROPY-SERIALIZED-COLUMNS--                                    COMMENT datatype:                                                               COMMENT - {name: System Name, datatype: string}                                 COMMENT - {name: Reference, datatype: string, description: ADS bibcode referen\ COMMENT ce for the measurement.}                                                COMMENT - {name: Notes, datatype: string}                                       COMMENT - {name: RA_errm, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: RA, unit: deg, datatype: float64, description: Right ascensio\ COMMENT n in degrees.}                                                          COMMENT - {name: RA_errp, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: Dec_errm, datatype: float64}                                   COMMENT - {name: Dec, unit: deg, datatype: float64, description: Declination i\ COMMENT n degrees.}                                                             COMMENT - {name: Dec_errp, datatype: float64}                                   COMMENT - {name: Period_errm, datatype: float64}                                COMMENT - {name: Period, unit: d, datatype: float64, description: Orbital peri\ COMMENT od in days.}                                                            COMMENT - {name: Period_errp, datatype: float64}                                COMMENT - {name: Eccentricity_errm, datatype: float64}                          COMMENT - {name: Eccentricity, datatype: float64}                               COMMENT - {name: Eccentricity_errp, datatype: float64}                          COMMENT - {name: M1_errm, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: M1, unit: solMass, datatype: float64, description: Presumed a\ COMMENT ccretor mass in solar masses.}                                          COMMENT - {name: M1_errp, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: M1_sin3i_errm, datatype: float64}                              COMMENT - {name: M1_sin3i, unit: solMass, datatype: float64, description: Proj\ COMMENT ected accretor mass term M1*sin(i)^3.}                                  COMMENT - {name: M1_sin3i_errp, datatype: float64}                              COMMENT - {name: M2_errm, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: M2, unit: solMass, datatype: float64, description: Presumed d\ COMMENT onor mass in solar masses.}                                             COMMENT - {name: M2_errp, datatype: float64}                                    COMMENT - {name: M2_sin3i_errm, datatype: float64}                              COMMENT - {name: M2_sin3i, unit: solMass, datatype: float64, description: Proj\ COMMENT ected donor mass term M2*sin(i)^3.}                                     